{"id":"296494bb2dbabc67","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-sigma2-approximation.md","title":"Σ₂ 的最终肯定近似及计算函数","display":"df-sigma2-approximation — Σ₂ 的最终肯定近似及计算函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-sigma2-approximation","aliases":["20-df-sigma2-approximation"],"display":"df-sigma2-approximation — Σ₂ 的最终肯定近似及计算函数","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 5.6.10（核对补集上横线）","source_printed_pages":[127],"source_pdf_pages":[162],"depends_on":["[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-sigma2-approximation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-sigma2-approximation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma2-approximation — Σ₂ 的最终肯定近似及计算函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.6.10（核对补集上横线）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>162</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\omega^2\\to2\">\\(a:\\omega^2\\to2\\)</span> 全可计算。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma2-approximation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall z\\ [z\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\ \\forall t\\ge N\\ a(z,t)=1],\\\\\nc_{a,A}^{\\Sigma_2}(x):=\\mu s\\ge x\\ \\forall z\\le x\\\n[z\\notin A\\Rightarrow\\exists t\\ (x\\le t\\le s\\land a(z,t)=0)]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma2-approximation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall z\\ [z\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\ \\forall t\\ge N\\ a(z,t)=1],\\\\\nc_{a,A}^{\\Sigma_2}(x):=\\mu s\\ge x\\ \\forall z\\le x\\\n[z\\notin A\\Rightarrow\\exists t\\ (x\\le t\\le s\\land a(z,t)=0)]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非成员无限多次取 0，保证有限多个非成员都在某个有限 frame 中出现 0，故计算函数存在。原书式 (5.18) 的补集横线不能丢掉；若改成成员需出现 0，该函数可能没有定义。此近似不要求非成员最终稳定。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.6.10（核对补集上横线）；印刷页 127；PDF 第 162 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\omega^2\\to2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma2-approximation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall z\\ [z\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\ \\forall t\\ge N\\ a(z,t)=1],\\\\\nc_{a,A}^{\\Sigma_2}(x):=\\mu s\\ge x\\ \\forall z\\le x\\\n[z\\notin A\\Rightarrow\\exists t\\ (x\\le t\\le s\\land a(z,t)=0)]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee412a4609cb21e2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma2-approximation]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。"}],"outgoing":["832f53dc90c8947a","e343870c773cb68e"]}